  "variants": {
    "ja": [
      {
        "id": "bell",
        "enabled": true,
        "text": "チャイムが鳴ったら、1時間目はサバイバル！ゾンビだらけの学校から逃げ切れる？無料・広告なしで挑戦。\nゲーム開始 ->\nhttps://escapezombie.com\nGoogle Play ストア ->\nhttps://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.jungyoon.zombieschool\n#ゾンビ学校",
        "imagePath": "image_pool/x/ja/marketing_social_30_20261004/01_bell_escape.png"
      },
      {
        "id": "supplies",
        "enabled": true,
        "text": "今日の持ち物：鉛筆、カバン、生き残る勇気。いつもの学校がゾンビ騒動に！無料・広告なしで遊ぼう。\nゲーム開始 ->\nhttps://escapezombie.com\nGoogle Play ストア ->\nhttps://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.jungyoon.zombieschool\n#ゾンビ学校",
        "imagePath": "image_pool/x/ja/marketing_social_30_20261004/02_pencil_survival.png"
      },
      {
        "id": "escape",
        "enabled": true,
        "text": "放課後なのに、帰り道はゾンビだらけ！夕焼けの向こうへ、生きて帰ろう。無料・広告なし。\nゲーム開始 ->\nhttps://escapezombie.com\nGoogle Play ストア ->\nhttps://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.jungyoon.zombieschool\n#ゾンビ学校",
        "imagePath": "image_pool/x/ja/marketing_social_30_20261004/04_b02_teacher.png"
      }
    ],
    "en": [
      {
        "id": "bell",
        "enabled": true,
        "text": "The bell rings. First lesson: survival! Can you escape a school full of zombies? Play free. No ads.\nStart game ->\nhttps://escapezombie.com\nGoogle Play Store ->\nhttps://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.jungyoon.zombieschool\n#EscapeZombieSchool",
        "imagePath": "image_pool/x/en/marketing_social_30_20261004/01_bell_escape.png"
      },
      {
        "id": "supplies",
        "enabled": true,
        "text": "Pencils? Check. Backpack? Check. Zombies? Wait, WHAT?! Turn school-day chaos into your escape story. Free to play. No ads.\nStart game ->\nhttps://escapezombie.com\nGoogle Play Store ->\nhttps://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.jungyoon.zombieschool\n#EscapeZombieSchool",
        "imagePath": "image_pool/x/en/marketing_social_30_20261004/02_pencil_survival.png"
      },
      {
        "id": "escape",
        "enabled": true,
        "text": "School's out. The zombies aren't. Make your after-school escape before they catch up! Play free. No ads.\nStart game ->\nhttps://escapezombie.com\nGoogle Play Store ->\nhttps://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.jungyoon.zombieschool\n#EscapeZombieSchool",
        "imagePath": "image_pool/x/en/marketing_social_30_20261004/04_b02_teacher.png"
      }
    ],
    "vi": [
      {
        "id": "bell",
        "enabled": true,
        "text": "Chuông reo! Tiết đầu tiên: sinh tồn. Bạn có thoát khỏi ngôi trường đầy zombie? Chơi miễn phí, không quảng cáo!\nBắt đầu trò chơi ->\nhttps://escapezombie.com\nCửa hàng Google Play ->\nhttps://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.jungyoon.zombieschool\n#TruongHocZombie",
        "imagePath": "image_pool/x/vi/marketing_social_30_20261004/01_bell_escape.png"
      },
      {
        "id": "supplies",
        "enabled": true,
        "text": "Bút chì, ba lô... và cả zombie?! Một ngày đi học bỗng thành cuộc chạy trốn hỗn loạn. Chơi miễn phí, không quảng cáo!\nBắt đầu trò chơi ->\nhttps://escapezombie.com\nCửa hàng Google Play ->\nhttps://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.jungyoon.zombieschool\n#TruongHocZombie",
        "imagePath": "image_pool/x/vi/marketing_social_30_20261004/02_pencil_survival.png"
      },
      {
        "id": "escape",
        "enabled": true,
        "text": "Tan học rồi, nhưng zombie chưa chịu về! Bạn có tìm được lối thoát dưới ánh hoàng hôn? Miễn phí, không quảng cáo!\nBắt đầu trò chơi ->\nhttps://escapezombie.com\nCửa hàng Google Play ->\nhttps://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.jungyoon.zombieschool\n#TruongHocZombie",
        "imagePath": "image_pool/x/vi/marketing_social_30_20261004/04_b02_teacher.png"
      }
    ],
